sequenceDiagram
autonumber
actor User
participant PreferencesController as UserNotificationPreferencesController
participant UpdatePrefsService as UpdateStationAlertPreferencesService
participant UpdateDeliveryService as UpdateDeliveryChannelsService
participant UserRepository as IUserRepository / MongoUserRepository
participant StationRepository as IStationRepository / MongoWeatherStationRepository
participant UserAggregate as User aggregate

User->>PreferencesController: PATCH /users/:id/subscriptions/:stationId or /delivery-channels
PreferencesController->>PreferencesController: ensureOwnUserAccess()

alt update station alert preferences
  PreferencesController->>UpdatePrefsService: execute({ userId, stationId, alertTypes })
  UpdatePrefsService->>UserRepository: findById(userId)
  UserRepository-->>UpdatePrefsService: user
  UpdatePrefsService->>StationRepository: findById(stationId)
  StationRepository-->>UpdatePrefsService: station
  UpdatePrefsService->>UserAggregate: updateAlertTypesForStation(stationId, alertTypes)
  UserAggregate-->>UpdatePrefsService: updated user
  UpdatePrefsService->>UserRepository: save(user)
  UserRepository-->>UpdatePrefsService: void
  UpdatePrefsService-->>PreferencesController: user
else update delivery channels
  PreferencesController->>UpdateDeliveryService: execute({ userId, telegramChatId })
  UpdateDeliveryService->>UserRepository: findById(userId)
  UserRepository-->>UpdateDeliveryService: user
  UpdateDeliveryService->>UserAggregate: configureTelegramDelivery(chatId)
  UserAggregate-->>UpdateDeliveryService: updated user
  UpdateDeliveryService->>UserRepository: save(user)
  UserRepository-->>UpdateDeliveryService: void
  UpdateDeliveryService-->>PreferencesController: user
end

PreferencesController-->>User: 200 UserResponse
